.serena/memories/private/

# docs (reveal.js)
docs/node_modules/
# dsh harness home (.dsh/ is bind-mounted to ~/.dsh — config-as-code, see
# .dsh/README.md): track settings.yaml, cordis.patch.yml, agent-presets/ and
# README.md; ignore the machine-state the harness generates.
/.dsh/profiles/
/.dsh/sessions/
/.dsh/storages/
/.dsh/.pnpm-store/
/.dsh/.env
/.dsh/.credentials.yaml
